  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and stir in 1 tbsp salt. Cook the egg noodles for 6 to 8 minutes until tender, then drain.",
    "Heat the butter and olive oil in a 12 inch skillet over medium-high heat. Add the mushrooms in one layer and cook for 8 minutes, stirring now and then, until browned and the liquid is gone.",
    "Lower the heat to medium. Add the onion and cook for 4 minutes until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic and cook for 30 seconds. Sprinkle the flour over the vegetables and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Slowly pour in the vegetable broth, stirring to scrape up the browned bits. Add the paprika, 1/2 tsp salt, and pepper.",
    "Simmer for 5 minutes until the sauce coats the back of a spoon.",
    "Turn the heat to low and stir in the sour cream. Warm for 1 minute without boiling, so the sauce stays smooth.",
    "Serve the stroganoff over the egg noodles and top with parsley."
  ],
